00:03:31.600 --> 00:03:33.380
the guy was jogging or not.

00:03:33.380 --> 00:03:35.860
Everybody's disputing every one of these facts.

00:03:35.860 --> 00:03:37.010
I hate to say it.

00:03:37.010 --> 00:03:38.490
