00:03:57.130 --> 00:04:00.470
certain types of cases becomes more and more
difficult to do that.

00:04:00.470 --> 00:04:04.030
But if you said, David, you've just you got
to bet you've got a bet on either they are

00:04:04.030 --> 00:04:10.420
found not guilty or guilty of some minor misdemeanor
that they plead down to or these individuals

00:04:10.420 --> 00:04:12.380
plead or are found guilty to felonies.

00:04:12.380 --> 00:04:14.750
I bet that they're not found guilty of felonies.

